## Data Models

### Device Object
```java
class Device {
    String id;              // "kitchen_light"
    String name;            // "Kitchen Light"
    String label;           // "Light"
    DeviceType type;        // LIGHT, FAN, BUZZER
    int gpioPin;            // 10, 11, 12, 16
    boolean isOn;           // true/false
}
```

### MQTT Messages

#### Control Messages (Android → ESP32)
```json
// Topic: smarthome/control
"kitchen_light_on"      // Turn on kitchen light
"kitchen_light_off"     // Turn off kitchen light
"bed1_light_toggle"     // Toggle bedroom light
"all_on"                // Turn all lights on
"all_off"               // Turn all lights off
"buzzer_on"             // Activate buzzer
"status"                // Request status update
```

#### Status Messages (ESP32 → Android)
```json
// Topic: smarthome/status
{
  "kitchen_light": "on",
  "bed1_light": "off",
  "living_light": "on",
  "buzzer": "off",
  "ip": "192.168.1.100",
  "rssi": -45
}
```

