## Build & Deployment Workflow

### Development Cycle

```
1. Code Changes
   ├── Edit Java/XML files
   │
2. Build Application
   ├── cd ~/aosp
   ├── source build/envsetup.sh
   ├── lunch [target]
   ├── mm SmartHomeControl
   │
3. Install on Device
   ├── adb install -r [apk]
   │   OR
   ├── adb push [apk] /system/app/
   ├── adb reboot
   │
4. Test & Debug
   ├── adb logcat | grep SmartHome
   ├── Test functionality
   │
5. Iterate
   └── Back to step 1
```

### Full AOSP Build

```
1. Clean Build (optional)
   ├── make clean
   │
2. Build Everything
   ├── source build/envsetup.sh
   ├── lunch [target]
   ├── make -j$(nproc)
   │   (Takes 2-8 hours)
   │
3. Flash Device
   ├── adb reboot bootloader
   ├── fastboot flashall -w
   │
4. Verify Installation
   └── Check app appears in launcher
```

