## Troubleshooting Quick Reference

| Issue | Check | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| App crashes on launch | `adb logcat` | Verify MQTT libs installed |
| MQTT won't connect | Network connectivity | Check WiFi, ping broker |
| Commands not reaching ESP32 | Topic names | Verify exact topic match |
| Status not updating | Subscription | Check ESP32 subscribes correctly |
| Relay not activating | Hardware | Verify relay wiring, active LOW |
| Service stops | Background restrictions | Whitelist app, foreground service |
| High battery drain | Wake locks | Optimize keepalive interval |

